WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:10.700
Sei! Hey! Stay with me, now!

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:12.570
Open your eyes!

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:15.370
Sei! C'mon, Sei!

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:16.370
Sei--

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:23.790
Hyou!

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:26.960
Sei!

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:30.880
Shin...

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:33.010
Don't... make a scene.

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:39.980
It'll... it'll affect morale.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:42.230
Sei...

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:43.650
He's all right!

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:47.030
You mean the Chin King is <i>here</i>?!

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:47.110
"Sho"

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:48.490
I knew it.

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:54.870
A great number of troops were calling
this injured man "Your Highness"!

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:58.450
That fits with the unusually high
morale of the Sai residents

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:00.790
and how the castle has stood firm.

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:04.540
During the Chin-Sho
alliance two years ago,

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:09.970
the only impression I had of the Chin King
was that of Ryo Fui's puppet.

00:01:09.970 --> 00:01:13.930
But turning Sai here into
an impregnable fortress

00:01:13.930 --> 00:01:17.350
is the inspired feat of
a great King indeed.

00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:23.980
Chin may very well have produced
a King to be reckoned with.

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:28.530
If so, it's all the more imperative
that we crush Chin here and now!

00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:36.490
The Chin King's presence
only simplifies this battle!

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:38.910
If we capture their King here,

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:42.870
we need only negotiate with Ryo Fui,
who holds Kanyou in his hands,

00:01:42.870 --> 00:01:45.040
and Kanyou will fall without bloodshed!

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:49.170
In other words, this battle here at Sai

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:52.420
is the <i>final </i>battle before Chin's ruin!

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:26.470
With All We Have

00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:28.190
All troops, fall back! Fall back!

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:34.360
Quickly, now--we're setting up camp!

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:36.610
Prepare to light the fires!

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:38.990
We'll assume a siege formation tonight!

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:40.780
Oh, th-thank goodness...

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:47.210
Shin Sei Jou.

00:03:47.210 --> 00:03:49.580
So the Chin King's here, eh?

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:55.840
Yes. Hence why I'm not storming
the castle after sunset.

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:59.130
We wouldn't want their King to escape.

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:02.930
I hear he was badly wounded
and had collapsed.

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:07.230
That's right. The whole castle
will know by morning.

00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:14.360
Then Sai is done for--at last.

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:15.360
Yes.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:18.700
Tonight,

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:22.070
we help His Highness escape.

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:24.620
What?! The hell are you talking about?

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:26.080
My lord!

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:30.540
We'll lose Sai tomorrow.

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:34.710
We don't have enough troops
to fight off the enemy, for one;

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:37.960
now with His Highness incapacitated,

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:41.220
we're without even our last hope: morale.

00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:43.800
All we can do now

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:47.770
is get His Highness out of this place.

00:04:47.770 --> 00:04:50.350
There will be objections, I know.

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:56.070
But no matter what happens,
His Highness must not die!

00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:58.150
Please--I beg of you!

00:04:58.150 --> 00:04:59.780
Please!

00:04:59.780 --> 00:05:03.370
Do you even know what that <i>means</i>, old man?

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:07.240
Sai can't fight without Sei around.

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:12.500
You'd be destroyin' Sai
by helpin' Sei escape!

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:16.960
Betrayin' all the Sai folks fightin' their
asses off for their kingdom, and--

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:22.340
Everything we've done
so far will be for nothing!

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:25.680
We stand to lose something even greater!

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:29.100
If His Highness falls alongside Sai,

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:32.940
Chin, too, will perish--
that much is certain!

00:05:32.940 --> 00:05:39.230
But if His Highness lives,
we may yet rebuild!

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:40.490
Besides...

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:43.780
His Highness Ei Sei
is no ordinary King!

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:49.240
You saw the changes that
came over the people of Sai.

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:53.080
Not even King Sho could
have accomplished that.

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:57.210
His Highness Ei Sei
cannot be permitted to die here--

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:58.420
period!

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:03.340
A subject's duty is to protect their King.

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:08.010
Given the circumstances, it wouldn't
be a mistake to evacuate ours.

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:10.270
It is a brave decision.

00:06:10.270 --> 00:06:16.020
The problem is whether we can
get His Highness to go along with it.

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:19.230
He will--I am sure of it.

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:25.200
His Highness has a deep
understanding of his own position.

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:28.830
Shin. You will be the one to tell him.

00:06:28.830 --> 00:06:34.540
I expect it will be most
convincing coming from you.

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:46.220
You alive?

00:06:51.850 --> 00:06:54.100
Well, you sure do <i>look </i>awful--

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:56.270
you're even paler than usual!

00:06:58.690 --> 00:07:01.900
It's terribly quiet out there.

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:04.990
Yeah. Kai Oku said you were
in a house to the north,

00:07:04.990 --> 00:07:07.740
in the complete opposite direction.

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:11.200
Your Highness! Oh, Your Highness!

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:11.200
Everyone's over there,
kickin' up a fuss.

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:12.200
I see.

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:17.290
So word got out to the
civilian troops after all.

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:21.210
It's also quiet 'cause the enemy
ain't launched a night attack.

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:24.050
We're probably lookin' at
an all-out attack tomorrow.

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:27.930
How ironic.

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:32.310
To think <i>this </i>is how we two
finally found time to chat.

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:33.470
Right?

00:07:35.770 --> 00:07:37.140
Listen, Sei...

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:46.280
Hey, that's right--aren't you havin'
yourself a baby? Congrats!

00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:49.450
Maybe that's a rough topic
to talk about now.

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:55.330
The mother is Kou, a court lady.

00:07:55.330 --> 00:07:56.750
Do you remember her?

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:57.750
Huh?

00:08:02.630 --> 00:08:04.210
Are you <i>serious</i>?

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:08.010
You got 2,000 knockouts
in that Inner Palace of yours,

00:08:08.010 --> 00:08:11.340
and out of all of 'em,
you pick that plain-lookin' girl?

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:14.600
Credit where credit is due, man!

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:15.600
<i>Hey</i>.

00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:20.730
All right, then: what about you?

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:23.900
Is there anyone on
your mind--in your heart?

00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:25.070
Huh?!

00:08:25.070 --> 00:08:27.150
Hell, <i>yeah</i>! You kiddin' me?

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:28.900
I'm a battalion commander!

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:32.370
I'm super popular everywhere I go--
a girl in every town!

00:08:32.370 --> 00:08:36.160
Wait! Who cares about that kinda crap?

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:38.120
You started it.

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:39.120
Shaddap!

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:44.090
Time to get down to brass tacks.

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:46.630
Listen, Sei...

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:49.510
So: you know Shou Bun Kun?

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:52.590
He's talking about gettin' you outta here.

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:53.720
You in?

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:55.390
Over my dead body.

00:08:56.810 --> 00:08:58.390
Right?

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:01.310
Didn't they ask you to persuade me?

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:02.850
Huh? Oh, yeah.

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:05.230
Sure I can't change your mind?

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:06.320
Impossible.

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:08.780
Knew it.

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:10.360
Well, that's that.

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:14.240
Sheesh. They really don't <i>get </i>you,

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:15.410
do they.

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:19.790
You <i>what</i>?!

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:23.080
What do you <i>mean</i>, you failed
to convince His Highness?

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:24.080
My bad.

00:09:27.550 --> 00:09:29.010
Why, you...

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:32.090
Don't you recognize the
<i>gravity </i>of the situation?!

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:39.930
Our leader Sei is sayin'
to stick with it till the very end.

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:42.980
All we can do is stay
right there with him!

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:47.400
This ain't like you, Shou Bun Kun.

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:50.280
Show me some of that
ol' tenacity of yours!

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:56.030
Day 6

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:01.830
When battle begins, so will
our assault on all four walls!

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:04.620
Quickly make your way
beyond the castle walls

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:06.960
and open the gates from within!

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:09.500
Storm the gates as soon as they're opened

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:12.050
and take control of the interior!

00:10:12.050 --> 00:10:15.140
Our goal: apprehend the King of Chin!

00:10:15.140 --> 00:10:18.180
If we can do this, we can take Kanyou!

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:22.390
You <i>must </i>find and capture the King of Chin!

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:25.400
Dead or alive, if it comes to that!

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:27.650
All troops, charge!

00:10:27.650 --> 00:10:29.320
Return fire!

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:36.570
They've gained control of the
right half of the south wall!

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:38.530
Report from the east wall!

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:42.660
The left corner is in danger--
where Lord Hyou's men can't reach!

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:43.870
It's no use...

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:47.210
So much for the civilians' morale.

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:50.130
The west wall is feeling
pressure on all fronts!

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:52.550
No word from the north wall yet,

00:10:52.550 --> 00:10:55.340
but as you can see from here,
there's a fair number of enemies--

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:01.680
Wh-What's all that cheering for?

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:04.060
Did we lose the stairs?

00:11:04.060 --> 00:11:06.810
No--the stairs are fine!

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:08.940
Then why in blazes are they cheering?

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:19.070
Your--

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:22.160
--Your Highness!
--Sire, you came!
--Oh, Your Highness!

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:26.960
Wh-What the--

00:11:26.960 --> 00:11:28.290
That's their King.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:29.630
Huh?!

00:11:29.630 --> 00:11:35.260
There's no point in hiding him any longer,
so he's right out in the open.

00:11:35.260 --> 00:11:39.760
Wasn't he gravely wounded--
on the brink of death?

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:41.430
--Sire!
--Oh, Your Highness!

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:44.390
--It's our King!
--Your Highness!

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:46.180
Sei...

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:50.810
Must be takin' everything
you got to stay conscious.

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:56.990
Man, you sure as hell
don't miss a trick, do you?

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:00.200
That's the King of Chin!

00:12:00.200 --> 00:12:01.370
Kill him!

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:04.660
Sei!

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:07.330
We're fine here! Keep movin'--and hurry!

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:16.970
Listen up, Hi Shin Force!

00:12:18.970 --> 00:12:21.220
Sorry for the long wait!

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:24.720
It's finally time for us to
show what we're made of!

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:26.180
What we're made of?

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:31.400
We're the squad that rolls up its sleeves
when the odds are most against us!

00:12:31.400 --> 00:12:33.860
Look! The walls are
crawlin' with enemies--

00:12:33.860 --> 00:12:35.730
we can fight like we <i>mean </i>it!

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:36.560
Hooray!

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:37.860
That idiot...

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:39.860
What's he going on about?

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:42.120
I gotta be honest with you--

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:45.910
the civilian troops've been
givin' twice what they got!

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:50.290
So it's up to us to give
<i>three </i>times what <i>we </i>got!

00:12:51.460 --> 00:12:54.920
And me? Just watch--
I'll be givin' <i>ten </i>times!

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:57.300
Is he for real?

00:12:57.300 --> 00:12:59.720
Damn. Brings a real tear to the eye...

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:03.050
seeing just how much of
a dumbass our captain is!

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:05.140
You're giving ten times?

00:13:05.140 --> 00:13:07.770
Then sign me up for <i>11</i>, you moron!

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:10.810
Shin...

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:14.270
You really aren't giving up, are you?

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:16.980
Ten!

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:19.320
I know!

00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:21.990
Move the civilian troops
to the rear and sides!

00:13:21.990 --> 00:13:24.240
Make room for the Hi Shin Force!

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:27.040
Split the squad in two under
Shin and So Sui!

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:30.710
Chu Tetsu and Den Ei, take over
for Den Yuu and Ryuu Sen!

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:33.420
En and Bi Hei
will support the whole squad!

00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:36.210
Hi Shin Force! Annihilate the enemy!

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:51.510
North Wall

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:51.020
Send 150 troops to Shou Bun Kun
on the west wall!

00:13:51.020 --> 00:13:51.690
Sir!

00:13:51.690 --> 00:13:53.480
And a hundred to the east wall, too!

00:13:53.480 --> 00:13:56.980
But Kai Oku, sir, sending out
all these reinforcements...

00:13:56.980 --> 00:14:00.860
The north wall is under
lighter attack than the others.

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:09.450
North Wall

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:09.450
West Wall

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:09.450
East Wall

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:09.450
South Wall

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:04.700
We beef up the struggling
east and west walls

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:09.790
so we can all share the same
equal, precarious footing!

00:14:09.790 --> 00:14:12.790
Sir! More reinforcements
from the north wall!

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:15.580
I thank you, Kai Oku...

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:20.960
There are two reasons Sai yet stands
even in these trying circumstances:

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:25.800
a King who pushes through
his injuries to cheer on the troops

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:28.100
and your presence.

00:14:28.100 --> 00:14:31.180
These balance out the crisis.

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:35.230
Your reinforcements plan
has allowed a Sai on the brink

00:14:35.230 --> 00:14:38.480
to maintain an exquisite equilibrium.

00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:44.200
My concern is the south wall.

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:48.280
It's directly opposite us--
our reinforcements can't get there.

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:56.330
So this is the Hi Shin Force!

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:58.880
And <i>that</i>... is Shin!

00:14:58.880 --> 00:15:00.630
S-Stay strong!

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:03.590
It's all these mooks
can do to stand upright!

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:08.050
Oh, shut up! You lost plenty
of manpower yourself!

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:09.050
Yo.

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:10.140
Huh?

00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:15.020
It's lookin' pretty lively
over here. We want in.

00:15:15.020 --> 00:15:17.060
Squadron Commander Den Yuu!

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:18.940
And Squadron Commander Ryuu Sen, too!

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:33.450
I-Is Shin okay? Give the man a rest.

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:36.410
We've been calling out
to him all this time,

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:38.670
but he's not even answering anymore.

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:40.540
You might not believe it,

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:44.670
but he singlehandedly cut down half
the enemy soldiers you see here.

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:48.640
What is <i>with </i>this guy?!

00:15:48.640 --> 00:15:51.390
It's highly likely he intends

00:15:51.390 --> 00:15:54.020
to face this one battle

00:15:54.020 --> 00:15:56.020
with all he has.

00:15:58.060 --> 00:16:01.190
Ri Boku, sir, there are too few
climbers in the south army.

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:03.400
Shall I send Fu Tei and Kaine up?

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:07.450
Those two are badly wounded.
They couldn't climb.

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:19.370
Is something the matter, Hou Ken?

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:23.090
The heavens are peering
down upon this castle.

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:28.220
Not with fear--with interest.

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:37.850
Does the might of those who fight even
beyond their limits surprise them?

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:39.850
Why not climb up there yourself?

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:50.240
Thou canst ill afford
to speak thus, Ri Boku.

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:58.370
We... we did it!
We made it through a sixth day!

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:03.750
Shin? Shin!

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:07.840
It's no use. There's no response at all.

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:09.010
What's wrong?

00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:12.010
Your Highness!

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:14.220
It's Shin--he won't come to.

00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:24.360
Shin.

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:28.780
Shin.

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:33.570
Hey. Sei.

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:36.660
He--he's awake! Amazing!

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:41.410
Wait. Why... why'm I sittin'?

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:46.920
It's over. Day six is over.

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:49.880
We defended Sai to the last.

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:51.340
Oh, yeah?

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:54.180
So day six is over...

00:17:54.180 --> 00:17:57.100
We did it, Sei.

00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:58.520
Yes.

00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:02.730
Huh. Well, okay... guess I'll sleep.

00:18:02.730 --> 00:18:05.400
Don't sleep, you idiot!
We gotta patch you up first!

00:18:05.400 --> 00:18:07.730
Shaddap! I'm <i>sleepy</i>.

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:11.990
That's fine. You sleep.
I can work on you here.

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:15.450
Hey. Ten.

00:18:15.450 --> 00:18:20.040
Your command made the fightin' easy.

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:22.160
Of course it did.

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:25.920
This is awful. The flesh around
his wounds is discolored.

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:31.720
Sei... don't tell me... you're makin'
the rounds again tonight.

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:36.300
No. My body wouldn't hold out if I did.

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:39.390
Tonight I'll behave--and get some sleep.

00:18:41.020 --> 00:18:42.640
What?! You don't mean...

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:44.390
His Majesty--<i>here</i>?

00:18:47.650 --> 00:18:49.440
But tomorrow...

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:51.440
How will we fight tomorrow?

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:54.780
Half the Hi Shin Force
was wiped out today.

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:56.700
Never mind about tomorrow!

00:18:56.700 --> 00:18:57.820
Huh?

00:18:57.820 --> 00:19:01.660
We just keep fighting,
leaving our fate to the heavens.

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:07.170
So right now, we take in the faces of
His Highness, of Shin--of each of us--

00:19:07.170 --> 00:19:09.710
and burn those faces into our memories.

00:19:11.130 --> 00:19:13.300
Kou...

00:19:13.300 --> 00:19:15.340
Do you believe in miracles?

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:24.180
I do.

00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:28.060
Aha...

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:30.980
Let that be your strength...

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:32.650
...as you fight on tomorrow.

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:39.400
Day 7

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:56.590
To think a castle not expected to last two
days would still be here on day seven.

00:19:57.720 --> 00:20:01.810
The power of their
fanatical morale ends here.

00:20:01.810 --> 00:20:05.680
They no longer have enough
troops to defend the castle.

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:11.400
So Sai has begun to waver...

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:16.320
A message for the seige units:

00:20:16.320 --> 00:20:19.320
Do not let a single person escape!

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:21.990
Sai has almost fallen.

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:27.040
Sei!

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:28.210
That's enough!

00:20:28.210 --> 00:20:31.290
Come here--come up here!

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:32.380
Tch...

00:20:32.380 --> 00:20:34.880
So it's finally gettin' dicey, huh.

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:38.340
Sh-Shin! Ten just told His Highness--

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:41.470
Can it! They'll just get more worked up!

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:43.310
En! Take over this spot!

00:20:43.310 --> 00:20:44.600
Y-Yessir!

00:20:44.600 --> 00:20:47.850
Dammit. This place ain't in trouble.

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:49.020
Which wall...?

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:52.600
North Wall

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:52.900
Uh-oh.

00:20:52.900 --> 00:20:56.440
Kai Oku, sir! The enemy's
encroaching on the stairs!

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:58.650
Never mind--I'll go myself!

00:20:58.650 --> 00:21:00.490
Send out more reinforcements!

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:04.490
I want 300 at the
west wall, immediately!

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:08.780
West Wall

00:21:06.790 --> 00:21:08.960
Don't let them get any closer!

00:21:08.960 --> 00:21:12.160
Defend the stairs at any cost!

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:13.590
Sir!

00:21:13.590 --> 00:21:16.710
The stairs--the other stairs--they're--

00:21:27.060 --> 00:21:28.060
No...

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:31.730
Stop!

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:49.700
East Wall

00:21:46.410 --> 00:21:49.080
Bi, sir! There's cavalry within the walls!

00:21:50.540 --> 00:21:51.580
My lord...

00:21:52.500 --> 00:21:55.130
Report! The west gate has opened,

00:21:55.130 --> 00:21:58.630
and a thousand cavalry
have stormed the castle!

00:22:01.420 --> 00:22:02.430
Excellent.

00:22:04.260 --> 00:22:06.220
"Sho" "Ri"

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:13.310
Sa... Sai has... fallen...

00:22:13.310 --> 00:22:15.230
It's done for...

00:22:25.820 --> 00:22:28.030
Dammit... no way...

00:22:29.410 --> 00:22:30.870
Damn it all!

00:22:32.250 --> 00:22:34.420
What now, Shin?

00:22:34.420 --> 00:22:36.380
If we're seeing it through, I'm with you.

00:22:40.550 --> 00:22:41.550
Shin?

00:22:48.640 --> 00:22:49.720
Shin...

00:22:57.770 --> 00:22:59.440
Cheer up, Kou.

00:23:06.700 --> 00:23:08.700
We just got our miracle.

00:23:15.500 --> 00:23:17.290
We stuck it out

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:19.090
and we're gonna win!

00:24:52.510 --> 00:25:02.020
Unprecedented Aid

00:24:54.180 --> 00:24:58.060
Next on <i>Kingdom</i>: "Unprecedented Aid."
